  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRC - Reduced deforestation and rural poverty</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduced deforestation and rural poverty through sustainable land use. The project will contribute to sustainable land use by mobilising civil society, religious leaders and local communities in advocating for the better implementation of key policies. The project will promote agroforestry and low impact and sustainable agricultural models for food and perennial crops that will increase the family income and livelihood while protecting the forests, biodiversity, soil and water resources.</narrative>
  </description>
